{"completed": true, "response": "他还不知道自己到底怕什么，就先让自己继续在意那个人，至于两个人以后会怎样，等以后再说。他眼下可以先好好喜欢对方，心里也没想着要对方给自己什么。这样想着，他慢慢就能放心地和那个人亲近了。\n\n他很喜欢这种感觉。他可以自然地对那个人好，把心里的温柔给对方，也不用老去确认对方有没有感受到。那个人对他很重要，他也还是能轻轻松松地和对方相处。有时他甚至觉得，自己比以前更自在了。原来把一个人放在心上，心里也不一定会跟着慌起来。他可以认真地在乎对方，也不用急着把两个人的关系抓牢。\n\n这种快乐确实让他心里踏实了些。他慢慢也不再怕自己喜欢那个人了，甚至有点满意，觉得自己能这么大方地喜欢一个人。要是两个人能一直这样自然地亲近下去，很多事都顺其自然就好，他也不用总追着问、事事计较，那该多好。他当时觉得，这样就够了。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4f079bbe-cef1-441c-abba-13e19eef3b27", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002158084696Z", "elapsed_seconds": 106.687, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:23:44.777426+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9a6186b71027ffdb55a2b29a96023fde9c47a6e8d98fef3b6b4036e2de45d684", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002158084696Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "1c42d722b4031620afac17b6cd0335cacb98cc66ed359f43abf4dba768d3a18b"}}}
